---
title: "transferInvestorPositionWithAuthorization (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_timing: check preconditions
    q_check_timing --> q_verify_sig: hasEnded AND refundPeriodExpired
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: refund period still active
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_target: verify legionSigner authorization signature
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_target --> q_transfer_pos: target address has no existing position
    q_check_target --> q_revert_exists: target already has position
    q_revert_exists --> [*]: revert PositionExists
    q_transfer_pos --> q_clear_old: copy position data to newAddress
    q_clear_old --> [*]: clear old position, emit PositionTransferred

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: cryptographic authorization from legionSigner required
        INV-002: signature prevents unauthorized position transfers
        INV-003: same timing and target constraints as direct transfer
    end note
